<workout_file><author>mywhooshinfo.com</author><name>Aerobic Ramps</name><description>Not every session needs to involve high-intensity efforts. Today&#039;s session is a low-intensity workout focussing on your aerobic fitness. 

One of the most important aspects of cycling is your aerobic fitness. This allows you to preserve vital glycogen stores and power up the day&#039;s final climb.</description><sportType>bike</sportType><workout>
<Warmup  Duration="180" PowerLow="0.44999998807907" PowerHigh="0.60000002384186"><textevent timeoffset="90" message="The warmup gradually increases in power."/><textevent timeoffset="130" message="By increasing your aerobic fitness, you will improve your ability to recover from the long climbs."/><textevent timeoffset="160" message="Now we ramp up the power each minute to continue the warmup."/></Warmup>
<SteadyState  Duration="60" Power="0.60000002384186"></SteadyState>
<SteadyState  Duration="60" Power="0.64999997615814"></SteadyState>
<SteadyState  Duration="60" Power="0.81000000238419"><textevent timeoffset="31" message="Just the 1min effort above threshold now."/></SteadyState>
<SteadyState  Duration="60" Power="1.0900000333786"></SteadyState>
<SteadyState  Duration="120" Power="0.5"><textevent timeoffset="80" message="4min just under threshold will complete your warmup."/></SteadyState>
<SteadyState  Duration="240" Power="0.88450002670288"><textevent timeoffset="80" message="This is the level of power you can expect to target on a long climb."/></SteadyState>
<SteadyState  Duration="120" Power="0.50449997186661"><textevent timeoffset="60" message="The main set today consists of 5 x 5min aerobic efforts."/></SteadyState>
<Warmup  Duration="300" PowerLow="0.61449998617172" PowerHigh="0.80449998378754"><textevent timeoffset="106" message="As the power increases aim to hold the same cadence."/><textevent timeoffset="235" message="The last minute should see an increase in your breathing rate."/></Warmup>
<SteadyState  Duration="120" Power="0.60449999570847"><textevent timeoffset="47" message="For the recovery we keep some pressure on the pedals."/></SteadyState>
<Warmup  Duration="300" PowerLow="0.61449998617172" PowerHigh="0.80449998378754"><textevent timeoffset="240" message="This is the kind of workout you can perform several times during the week."/></Warmup>
<SteadyState  Duration="120" Power="0.65450000762939"><textevent timeoffset="55" message="Remember, it&#039;s fine to complete some low intensity work."/></SteadyState>
<Warmup  Duration="300" PowerLow="0.61449998617172" PowerHigh="0.80449998378754"><textevent timeoffset="236" message="How does the last minute feel?"/><textevent timeoffset="281" message="Still comfortable?"/></Warmup>
<SteadyState  Duration="120" Power="0.65450000762939"><textevent timeoffset="68" message="Just 2 intervals to go."/></SteadyState>
<Warmup  Duration="300" PowerLow="0.61449998617172" PowerHigh="0.80449998378754"><textevent timeoffset="151" message="Are you holding the same cadence as the earlier intervals?"/><textevent timeoffset="171" message="A decreased cadence indicates fatigue is accumulating."/></Warmup>
<SteadyState  Duration="120" Power="0.65450000762939"><textevent timeoffset="58" message="Last effort now."/></SteadyState>
<Warmup  Duration="300" PowerLow="0.61449998617172" PowerHigh="0.80449998378754"><textevent timeoffset="143" message="This is a good session to maintain your aerobic fitness."/></Warmup>
<Cooldown  Duration="300" PowerLow="0.75449997186661" PowerHigh="0.50449997186661"><textevent timeoffset="30" message="Now for a nice cool down."/></Cooldown>
</workout></workout_file>